# AI/ML Experiment Rules

## 실험 설계 원칙

### 1. 재현 가능성 (Reproducibility)
```python
# 시드 고정
import random
import numpy as np
import torch

def set_seed(seed: int = 42):
    random.seed(seed)
    np.random.seed(seed)
    torch.manual_seed(seed)
    if torch.cuda.is_available():
        torch.cuda.manual_seed_all(seed)

set_seed(42)
```

